<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Yoonaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yoonaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoonaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoona</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoonaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoonaasa tinbitey Xoossas azazettike gida issi nabe bolla gakkida dumma dumma metota yootiza maxaafa gidida gishshas hara tinbite maxaafatappe dummatees. Xoossi Yoonaasa, «Isra7eele asaas mino morkke gidida gita Asoore kawoteththas waanna katama Nannawe ba!» giidi iza azazides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoonaasi gidikko, «Xoossay katamayo dhayssanaas immida mino qofsozas izi gida mala ooththenna» gi qoppida gishshas Xoossa qaala ekkidi Nannawe baanaas koyibeenna; daro hanoti handaappe guye keehi ufayettontta dishe azazettides; izi buro hanana gida iza qaalazi polettontta aggiin lancettides.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafazi Xoossas iza medheteththa ubbaa bolla godateththi dizayssa erisees. Harappeka Xoossi siiqonne maariza Godaa gidida gishshas ba deraa morkketa bolla hanqettidi mulera dhayssanaappe atto giidi maaranaas dosizayssa bessees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Godaappe Yoonaasa baqata <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 1:1-7">1:1-7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonaasa woosa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yoonaasi Nannawe biin dereza maareteth <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi dereza maarida gishshas Yoonaasa hanqeteth <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoonaasi Azazettontta Ixo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1"/>Amaate naa Yoonaasakko GODAA qaalay,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:25">2Kawo 14:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2"/>«Dendada he gita katamaa Nannawe ba; he katamaa asaa iitateth ta be7idayssa isttas yoota» gishe yides. <verse eid="JON 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3"/>Gido attiin Yoonaasi GODAA sinththafe baqatidi Tarseese biitta baanaas dendides; izi Yoophphe katamaa wodhidi Tarseese biza markabe demmides; GODAA sinththafe baqatidi isttara Tarseese baanaas miish qanxxidi markabezan gelides.<verse eid="JON 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4"/>Markabezi bishin GODAY abba bolla gote carko denththiin abba dambalay keehi darida gishshas markabezi meqqana gakkides. <verse eid="JON 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5"/>Histtiin markabezan diza asay babbida gishshas wurikka ba xoossaako waassides; qasse markabezi kawuyana mala iza giddon diza caanaa denththidi abbaan olida; gidikkoka Yoonaasi markabezas garsa kifile wodhidi heen deexo dhisko wodhides.<verse eid="JON 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6"/>Markabeza halaqay izakko biidi, «Ays dhiskadii? Dendada ne xoossaa woossa! Izi ba lo7o ayfen xeellidi nuna ashshanaakko ooni erizee!» gides.<verse eid="JON 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7"/>Markabezan diza asay issoy issaa, «Haa yiite! Hayssi iita miishshi oona gaason nuna gakkidaakko eranaas ane saama yeggoos» gida; histtiin istti saama yeggiin saamay Yoonaasa bolla wodhdhides. <verse eid="JON 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8"/>Hessafe guye istti Yoonaasa, «Hayssi iita miishshi oona gaason nu bolla gakkidaakko ane nuus yoota! Ne oosoy aazee? Awappe yadii? Ne derey awa? Neni oona zereththee?» gi oychchida.<verse eid="JON 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9"/>Histtiin Yoonaasi zaaridi, «Tani Ibraawe asa; abbaanne biittaa medhdhida salo GODAA goynnays» gides.<verse eid="JON 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10"/>Hessa gishshas Xoossa sinththafe izi baqatizayssa izi isttas yootidayssafe asay erida gishshas keehi Babbidi, «Haysso ay pala miish ooththadii?» gida.<verse eid="JON 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11"/>Qasse abba dambalay kaseyssafe haa darida gishshas asay Yoonaasa, «Nuus abbay co7u gaana mala nena nuni wosttinoo?» giidi oychchida.<verse eid="JON 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12"/>Izikka isttas, «Hayssi wolqqama dambalay intte bollan dendiday ta gaason gididayssa ta erays; hessa gishshas tana denththidi abban olite; histtiko abbay inttes co7u gaana» gides.<verse eid="JON 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13"/>Gido attiin markabezan diza asay markabeza guye abba lanqe kessanaas minththi laaggida shin abba dambalay keehi darida gishshas kessanaas dandaybeettenna. <verse eid="JON 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14"/>Hessa gishshas isttas, «Abeet GODAWU! Hayssa addeza shemppo gishshas neni nuna dhayssontta malanne hayssa geeshsha suuththa acozakka neni nuuppe oychchontta mala nuni nena keehi woossoos. Ays giikko GODAWU neni ne koyida mala ooththadasa» giidi GODAAKKO waassida.<verse eid="JON 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15"/>Hessafe guye Yoonaasa denththidi abban oliin abba dambalay co7u gides. <verse eid="JON 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16"/>Histtiin asay GODAAS keehi babbides; GODAAS yarsho yarshida; adinakka adinettida.<verse eid="JON 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17"/>Yoonaasa mittana mala issi gita mole GODAY giigsiin he moleza ulon Yoonaasi heedzdzu gallassinne heedzdzu omars aqides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mato 12:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoonaasa Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1"/>Yoonaasi moleza ulon dishe ba GODAAKKO, <verse eid="JON 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2"/>«Tani tuggaa giddon dashe GODAA xeygiin izi taas koyides; tani hayqqidayti diza ciimma giddon dashe neekko waassadis; nekka ta waaso siyadasa. <verse eid="JON 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3"/>Ne tana ciimma abba giddo duge yeggadasa; haaththi tana dooddides; ne Dambalay ta bollara aadhdhides. <verse eid="JON 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4"/>Hessa gishshas tani, ‹Ta ne sinththafe wora olettadis; gidikkoka ta ne geeshsha keeththaa qasseka zaara be7ana› gadis.<verse eid="JON 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5"/>«Haaththay taas qoodhe gakkanaas mittides; ciimma abbay tana mittides; abbaa giddon diza maataykka ta hu7e bolla xaaxettides. <verse eid="JON 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6"/>Tani zumata gars duge wodhdhadis; heen biittaa garsan mernaas gordan uttadis; gidikkoka abeet ta GODAWU! Neni ta shemppo ciimma ollafe kessadasa.<verse eid="JON 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7"/>«Tani hayqqana matida wode nena GODAA qoppadis. Ta woosaykka neekko pude geeshsha keeth gakkides. <verse eid="JON 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8"/>Hada eeqata kaallizayti wuri nenan GODAAN ammanettanayssa aggida. <verse eid="JON 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9"/>Gido attiin ta galata nees yarshana; ta adinettidayssa ubbaaka gaththana; ays giikko atoteththi GODAAPPE yees» gi woossides.<verse eid="JON 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10"/>Hessafe guye GODAY moleza azaziin molezi Yoonaasa biitta bolla cooyides.<verse eid="JON 2:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoonaasa Azazeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1"/>GODAA qaalay nam7anththo Yoonaasakko, <verse eid="JON 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2"/>«Dendada he gita katamaa Nannawe baada tani nees yootiza qaalaa isttas awajja» gishe yides.<verse eid="JON 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3"/>Histtiin Yoonaasi dendidi GODAA qaalaaththo Nannawe bides. Nannawey keehi gita katama; ha gaxappe he gaxa gakkanaas heedzdzu gallas hemeththees. <verse eid="JON 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4"/>Yoonaasi Nannawe katama bi gakkidi issi gallassa oge mala katamaas giddo biidi, «Oyddu tammu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oyddu tammu gizayssa laappun tammu eranchchata birsheththan heedzdzu gallas gees.</char></note> gallassafe guye Nannawey dhayana» giidi awajjides.<verse eid="JON 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5"/>Histtiin Nannawe asay Xoossaa ammanidi xooma awajjides; gitatappe guuththata gakkanaas wurikka maaqa may7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mato 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:32">Luqa 11:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6"/>Yo7ozi Nannawe kawookko gakkiin izi ba kawoteththaa araataappe wodhdhidi kawoteththaa may7o may7idayssa qaaridi maaqa may7idi bidinththan uttides. <verse eid="JON 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7"/>Histtidi Nannawe asaas, «Kawozappenne kawo oosanchchatappe imettida azazo mala hachchife doommidi asinne mehey ubbay aykkoka mooppo; haaththika uyoppo. <verse eid="JON 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8"/>Asaykka meheykka wuri maaqa may7o; asi wuri minththidi Xoossako waasso; ba iita ogeppenne qoho oosoppeka simmo. <verse eid="JON 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9"/>Histtiko Xoossay nuus qadhettidi nu dhayontta mala ba wolqqama hanqofe simmanaakko oonee erizay» gides.<verse eid="JON 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10"/>Istti ba iita ogeppe simmidayssa Xoossay be7idi isttas qadhettidi istta bolla ehana gida pirdaa aggides.<verse eid="JON 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yoonaasa Yiillonne Xoossa Qadheteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1"/>Yoonaasi gidikko he hanoza ubbaan ufayettibeenna; hessa gishshas keehi hanqettides; <verse eid="JON 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2"/>Hessafe guye GODAA, «Abeet GODAWU! Tani buro ta deren dashe gidayssi hayssa gidennee? Ta ne sinththafe betada Tarseese baanaas eesotidayssi hessassa; qadhetaynne maarotay nenan kumida Xoossaa ne gididayssa, hanqos eesotonttayssanne aggontta siiqon kumidayssa, qasse ehana gida iita miishshika aggiza Xoossa ne gididayssa tani kasekka erays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Kessa 34:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3"/>Abeet GODAWU! Ha7i ta shemppo ekka; paxa duussafe taas hayqoy lo7o» gi woossides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:4">1Kawo 19:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4"/>Histtiin GODAY izas, «Tumu ne hayssas hanqettanaas bessizee?» gides.<verse eid="JON 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5"/>Yoonaasi katamaappe kezi biidi arshey mokkiza baggan uttides; katamaa bolla gakkizaaz beyanaas heen baas daase daasidi iza kuwan uttides. <verse eid="JON 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6"/>Arshe seelappe Yoonaasa ashshanaas GODAY issi gose dolisides; he gosey diccidi Yoonaasa kuwasides; Yoonaasi he gosey gishshas keehi ufayettides. <verse eid="JON 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7"/>Gido attiin wonteththa gallas maalado Xoossay guxune kiittides; he guxuneya gosey xapho duuththiin goseya meladus. <verse eid="JON 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8"/>Arshey mokkiza wode Xoossay xuuggiza carko arshey mokkiza baggafe yeddides; hessafe dendidayssan Yoonaasi daaburana gakkanaas away Yoonaasa hu7e xuuggides; histtiin izi, «Paxa daanaappe taas hayqoy lo7o» gides.<verse eid="JON 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9"/>Histtiin Xoossay Yoonaasas, «Tumu neni ha gosey gishshas hanqettanaas bessizee?» gides.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Yoonaasikka, «Ee! Hayqqana gakkanaas hanqettanaas taas bessees» gides.<verse eid="JON 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10"/>Histtiin GODAY Yoonaasas, «Issi gallas mokkada, nam7anththo gallas melida goseys neni izin daaburonttaarissinne izo dichchonttaaris hayssa mala mishettaasashin, <verse eid="JON 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11"/>ushachchinne hadirs shaakki erontta xeetanne nam7u tammu shiyappe bollara diza dereynne daro mehey diza ha gita Nannawe katamays ta mishettanaas bessennee?» gides.<verse eid="JON 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4"/>
</usx>
